  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/i1uj0agxe82r694kas9pw/Epic-Samurai-s.png?rlkey=ytalttq9tbiyzbg6g4zn28wac&st=ykia1ia7&dl=1\" width=\"706\" height=\"446\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.20.1 -msg?style=for-the-badge&label=Minecraft Version&color=a40d3f&cacheSeconds=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" alt=\"Static Badge\" width=\"175\" height=\"22\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge -msg?style=for-the-badge&label=Modloader&color=a40d3f&cacheSeconds=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" alt=\"Static Badge\" width=\"150\" height=\"22\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/REQUIRED -msg?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=Curios API&color=a40d3f&cacheSeconds=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" alt=\"Static Badge\" width=\"176\" height=\"22\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/azurelib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/REQUIRED -msg?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=Azurelib&color=a40d3f&cacheSeconds=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" alt=\"Static Badge\" width=\"157\" height=\"22\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://discord.gg/28E3kQk7RD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CLICK -msg?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&color=a40d3f&cacheSeconds=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" alt=\"Static Badge\" width=\"128\" height=\"22\"></a>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/bh13qlac2wzhftq/sC6L3HF.png?dl=1\" width=\"1708\" height=\"14\"></p>\n</div>\n<h1><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Samurai/BH_ES_Features.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></h1>\n<p>探索日本武器的世界。尝试收集所有不同类型的盔甲，包括忍者或武士的盔甲。升级它们并获得独特的技能。</p>\n<p>通过炸开新材料“钢”，你将解锁所有不同的武器和盔甲。你可以与妖怪战斗，利用妖怪的能力来升级你的武器。</p>\n<p>你能在一个充满危险日本生物的世界中生存下来吗？</p>\n<p><em><strong>注意：此模组仍在开发中，因此可能会崩溃并包含错误。</strong></em></p>\n<h2>📦 安装</h2>\n<h3>必需依赖</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/azurelib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Azurelib (版本 0.0.32 或更高)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terrablender</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-trees-youll-grow\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Trees You'll Grow</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>强烈推荐</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 JEI 或 REI 查看合成配方！</li>\n<li>使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a>（由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/daedelus_dev\" rel=\"nofollow\">daedelus_dev</a> 制作）</li>\n<li>使用 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-roll\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combat Roll</a>（由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/daedelus_dev\" rel=\"nofollow\">daedelus_dev</a> 制作）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>兼容模组 (仅限 1.20.1)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquaculture 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blood-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blood Magic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eldritch-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eldritch End</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden and Arcanus</a></li>\n<li>1.21.1 将添加附加模块！</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>附加模组：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/turtledynasty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Turtle Dynasty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nichirin-dynasty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nichirin Dynasty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizard-samurai-irons-spells-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wizard Samurai</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong>注意：此模组不兼容 Optifine！替代方案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embeddium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oculus</a>！</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong>加入我们的社区 Discord！ </strong></em><strong>查看</strong><em><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/4A9SEahH4U\" rel=\"nofollow\">PixelDreamStudios</a> - </strong></em><strong>官方合作伙伴！</strong></p>\n<p><em><strong>加入我的个人 Discord - <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Eeqm5NMDK3\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a></strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fPixelDream\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/qbmdpbq5yc5x8o45a5q8n/BH_NU_PROMO.png?rlkey=96ehoczxgelxdzyy1qwgnc81h&st=rjjtmes5&dl=1\" width=\"550\" height=\"120\"></strong></em></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/bh13qlac2wzhftq/sC6L3HF.png?dl=1\" width=\"1708\" height=\"14\"></strong></em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Samurai/BH_ES_Credits.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft-garage.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft-garage.com/</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;提供盔甲模型和物品纹理</em></strong></li>\n<li><strong><em><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/Alexth99/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexth99</a>&nbsp;负责 Ars Nouveau 兼容</em></strong></li>\n<li><strong><em>Damienbrittan&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fde.fiverr.com%252fdamienbrittan\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://de.fiverr.com/damienbrittan</a> 负责令人惊叹的标志设计<br></em></strong></li>\n<li><strong><em><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/starrysock/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Starrysock</a> 负责生物群系方块、钢材以及怪物掉落物品的重构</em></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/bh13qlac2wzhftq/sC6L3HF.png?dl=1\" width=\"1708\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Samurai/BH_ES_Showcase.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/K0qD8LimyUs?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YAXO-Rzhriw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/53_Bwo2ju64?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eBk2znNuAsk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/D-oqZebKhgs?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/L40nyc-pZ_s?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/426VTW8PkIo?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j3vW0XuL5DI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/bh13qlac2wzhftq/sC6L3HF.png?dl=1\" width=\"1708\" height=\"14\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Samurai/BH_ES_Faq.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>&raquo; 我在哪里可以找到矿石？</strong></p>\n<p><strong> <em>在 Y 坐标 -64 到 30 之间。在 Y -20 处寻找大型洞穴是找到它们的最佳方法。</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong> &raquo; 我如何攻击怪物？ </strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>在模组的旧版本中，你需要“鬼杀”附魔。</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong>&raquo; 我如何驯服怪物？</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>你可以用骨头驯服小豆狸 (Komainu)，用任何药水驯服河童 (Kawauso) 和狸猫 (Tanuki)。(只有小豆狸可以繁殖 -&gt; 牛肉)<br></em></strong></p>\n<p><strong> &raquo; 我如何合成物品？ </strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>使用 JEI 查看模组中的所有合成配方。</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong> &raquo; 你会添加更多内容吗？ </strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>模组仍在开发中 (WIP)。这是模组的测试版。</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong> &raquo; 有维基或指南吗？</strong></p>\n<p><strong> <em>是的，安装 Patchouli 模组，你就可以制作指南书。</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong> &raquo; 该模组是否与 Optifine 兼容？</strong></p>\n<p><strong> <em>不兼容，请使用 Rubidium 配合 Oculus 以获得着色器和性能提升。</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong>&raquo; 我可以将此模组添加到我的整合包中吗？</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em> 当然可以。</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong>&raquo; 会有 Fabric 版本吗？</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em> 抱歉，我不会将模组移植到 Fabric。</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong>&raquo; 该模组也适用于基岩版吗？</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em> 不，这些模组仅针对 Java 版开发。</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong>&raquo; 你能向后移植到 1.12.2/1.16.4/1.18.2 版本吗？</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em> 抱歉，我不会将模组向后移植到较旧的 Minecraft 版本。<br><br></em></strong></p>\n<p><strong>&raquo; 为什么我找不到指南书？</strong></p>\n<p><em><strong>它仍在开发中，目前处于禁用状态。</strong></em></p>\n<p><strong>&raquo; 我可以用这个模组制作视频/直播吗？</strong></p>\n<p><em><strong>当然可以。</strong></em></p>\n</div>",
